{"games":[{"id":17646389208,"name":"Decent Planet Game","desc":"🪐 DPG is a space exploration game with it being inspired by Untitled Planet Game, This game is also still undergoing plenty of changes.\n\n🌎 Explore all the systems, Build colonies, terraform countless celestial bodies, create ships big enough to span across the galaxy, and earn stacks of cash from multiple methods of gameplay.\n\n80+ star systems, and over 480+ planets and moons.\n\n🔨 Credits:\n\nGravity Script: From Froster\nLighting Script: From Adam_Hase\n\n🚀 Special Thanks:\n@LarperOfDestruction\n@SANIKENCANA\nfor aiding others when flying wasn't added yet","path":"/game/17646389208-decent-planet-game","slug":"17646389208-decent-planet-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ca0eb4ffb9c2cc4139a67b1e57ffb7fe25adc3e5950dee6839d79e97b2d32142.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a582f1717ad7e8a3bc2ba871c904c3df/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":2298648,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-05T15:42:07.191Z","creator":{"name":"Decent Planet Gamers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":120422369296283,"name":"Medieval Prison - Roleplay Servers","desc":"Main game: https://www.roblox.com/games/139611815752894/Medieval-Prison-RP\n\nPrison Life: Medieval Edition","path":"/game/120422369296283-medieval-prison","slug":"120422369296283-medieval-prison","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/395be0255d8654ebecc56d1837531ebf44e6ce72b482fc0968e99ff9d9c20f3e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5e20aa9990ef56e6e18d7e2cf0d1596c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":4272154,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-03T12:40:26.878Z","creator":{"name":"watermeloncamel1","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14746343732,"name":"TashTram - Трамвай Ташкента","desc":"Симулятор трамвая, троллейбуса и автобуса. Ташкентский трамвай.\nTram, trolleybus and bus simulator. Tashkent tram.\n\nПолучите удовольствие от поездки по маршрутам Ташкентского трамвая, троллейбуса или автобуса.\n\nВ следующем обновлении:\n+ Новые линии маршрутов.\n+ Новые модели трамваев.\n+ Небольшая детализация городской среды. \n\nСообщайте о проблеме, если она возникла. Хорошей поездки!\n\nNext update:\n+ New route lines\n+ New models of trams\n+ Small detailing of the urban environment.\n\nLet me know if there is a problem. Have a good trip!\n","path":"/game/14746343732-tashtram","slug":"14746343732-tashtram","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b7da7ffd5039cfb99ac45c6e43906a28c815907cb2fa8a510c87bce8c4ffd8a1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b76c813eb96a4b91cac7e90d54760e2a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":7848997,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-07T15:09:07.435Z","creator":{"name":"Rukkakola","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":98132581894671,"name":"[UPDATE] Conquest: Napoleonic Wars [Pre-Alpha]","desc":"Pre-Alpha v6.8.4.1: Balance Changes\n\nConquest: Napoleonic Wars is a real time strategy (RTS) game based on the Napoleonic era, inspired by Napoleon Total War and a successor to Conquest by captainwoodlegs. \n\nKeybinds\nR = Rotate units\nZ = Show units range\nH = toggle march at same speed\nX = ping\nC = halt selected units\nQ = select all the units\nE = deselect all selected units\nLeft control = see all the units goals positions without having them selected\nLeft control and click on an unit = select units without deselect.\nT + click = move units into a line automatically\nShift + click = move all the selected units in formation rather than all to the same place\nShift + click a unit = selecting all the units of the same type\nShift + press a number = select all units of the same type\n\nMOBILE \nDouble tap and hold = dragging to select multiple units at once\n\nUse /private in your own private server to open or close the servers settings UI\nUse /unstuck if ur character cant move","path":"/game/98132581894671-conquest-napoleonic-wars","slug":"98132581894671-conquest-napoleonic-wars","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9b2e64d025fa95792fc77e90cb1372b6d26b00885d14fe05e2950c57032675f9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e783896bac7bc1f0cae64a47efe9485/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":5359319,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-31T23:45:22.303Z","creator":{"name":"Conquest: Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16949509473,"name":"[36.0] Toilet RP","desc":"Credits To..\n  - Daf4q?Boom?! For the morph ideas,\n  - malluffyaizat for the titan morphs and a few of the toilet morphs,\n  -  darkness for the watch man of doom flowting head and core,\n  -  ShadowAceYT2009 for the executor morph\nThanks!\n\nWe Appreciate if you would Upvote the game!\n\nVersion 1.0: Game Released!\n\nVersion 1.5: Bug Fixes\n\nVersion 2.0: New Infected Titan Speaker Man, Speakerman, and Cameraman Morphs\n\nVersion 3.0: New Titan TVMan Morph and Speaker Upgrade\n\nVersion 3.5: New EP 70 Mech Scientist and Rocket Toilets\n\nVersion 3.75: New Ability and Bar for TTVM, G-Toilet 2.0 Redesign\n\nVersion 3.8: New Big City Map\n\nVersion 4.0: 5 New Toilets, Updated UIs, New Scientist Speakerman, Cameraman, TVMan Morph\n\nVersion 5.0: New UTCM, UTSM, and Large TVMan Morphs\n\nVersion 5.5: New UTSM Abilities, G-Toilet 3.0\n\nVersion 5.6: 2 New Maps\n\nVersion 5.65: Bug Fixes\n\nVersion 6.0: New Injured UTCM, Fake G-Toilet\n\nVersion 6.5: New Titan Boombox Man\n\nVersion 7.0: SBSD Morphs","path":"/game/16949509473-toilet-rp","slug":"16949509473-toilet-rp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/92f18e51304f6aa401bd79951e6dcb4ec3617635564ab9292c174d8bfffa9001.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-98f4f5388d76024541240748e43303d1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":12116384,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-02T12:51:18.744Z","creator":{"name":"Toilet RP Studios’","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8401705986,"name":"Become SCP-096","desc":"In this game, you can play as SCP-096. As 096, you can wander the landscape and kill any human that upsets you.\nYou can also play as a human, you get given tools to survive and explore.\n\nControls are listed inside of the game in the settings menu. ⚙\n\nWhen buying a private server, you are entitled to the HD Admin VIP commands in that server only.\nType \";cmds\" in chat to view your commands. ⚙\n\nDISCLAIMER: Not all models, sounds, and animations were made by me.\n\nGame can be quite buggy sometimes :/ 🛠\nMany features are still yet to arrive. 📝","path":"/game/8401705986-become-scp-096","slug":"8401705986-become-scp-096","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cbb027bca7c48fd5e3e3f30c64346e721a25962554d8c56a9d47e20a02d71afb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3df649668735da31ceab3ffd1812ce2e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":20233709,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-19T16:13:44.562Z","creator":{"name":"Wreage16","type":"User"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12445957257,"name":"❄️ Watch a TV! ","desc":"ITEMS HAVE BEEN RESTORED FOR OLD PLAYERS! If you've played before the Rewrite Update, your items should have been automatically restored into your inventory! Sorry for all the troubles beforehand.\n\nWelcome to Watch a TV! As the name suggests, watch some quality television or broadcast yourself on TV! Collect rare items, hang out with friends, or explore the open map!  \n\nPrivate Servers allow you to change TV Channels for free!\n\nSupported devices: Mobile, PC, VR (Console is so-so)\n\nIf you need help with anything such as purchases or information, post on the Blitzen Productions group forums! Staff will also check it occasionally.\n\nWE WILL PERMANENTLY BAN PLAYERS WHO BREAK ROBLOX'S TOS DUE TO AN AVATAR, CHAT LOGS, ETC. !!","path":"/game/12445957257-watch-a-tv","slug":"12445957257-watch-a-tv","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/04043e49ea39370faaf28cd8b8477743f9234ea1f0484dce81af270c04953508.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7438079d18aff084a089e3e8826a885f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":10888860,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-11-17T06:43:32.663Z","creator":{"name":"BIitzens","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7528927029,"name":"Korean Zombie: Roleplay","desc":"ALL OF US ARE DEAD RP\n\nOfficial group:\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/12531908/RP\n\n• Student\nEscape from a school full of zombies and go to the shelter or other locations!\nBuy various weapons and defeat the infected!\n\n• Special forces, Martial law army, Police, etc.\nRescue stranded students and evacuate them to safety!\nWork with others to defeat the infected!\n\n• A role-playing game based on a Netflix drama.\n• Play as a student, soldier or cop in a world infected with the zombie virus!","path":"/game/7528927029-korean-zombie-roleplay","slug":"7528927029-korean-zombie-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/45f8c1163256cb6dc790278e25e7e8026cbd521758ee3d39dda43bb2999bb327.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-48fa17d3eb137d180cd89ad4081b17bc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":5381171,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-02-17T06:04:58.521Z","creator":{"name":"lIIIIIIIIlllllIlIl","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":841005469,"name":"Sky Wars","desc":"","path":"/game/841005469-sky-wars","slug":"841005469-sky-wars","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a6caca5a9d7ebc4c85efa304e429a0f1e0151f39580a274eb47e43b53b42b7ce.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-534dcbcc14f3d9572ce36bd9d1130d88/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":25,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","typ